Read AGENTS.md and follow it across this project.
At session start read START_HERE.md, HANDOFF.md, and STATE.json.
Use docs/BUILD_PLAN.md for task order and acceptance criteria.
Use docs/ARCHITECTURE.md for interfaces and trust boundaries.
Use docs/EVALUATION.md before modifying data, scoring, or learning behavior.
Do not invent completion, commands, library APIs, evidence, or benchmark values.
Verify the actual HydraDB interface before writing dependent code.
Keep at most one task IN_PROGRESS and update the handoff after each verified task.
Do not import ReliefGrid architecture into this standalone project.
